ing, but exploiting enemy weaknesses and overcoming their defenses through the unique Break &amp; Fracture system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766600/extras/f98639f4c8b59a953976feca2d07c293.avif?t=1773407703\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Turn-Based Battle System:</strong> Overcome vicious beasts and strange anomalies in tactical turn-based combat, requiring careful use of each of your characters' abilities, equipment, and the unique dual light/dark energy system to prevail!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766600/extras/677d84dad3b9776a613fc1aa943c963d.poster.avif?t=1773407703\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766600/extras/677d84dad3b9776a613fc1aa943c963d.webm?t=1773407703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break &amp; Fracture System:</strong> Chip away at the enemy's health - or identify and exploit their weaknesses to put them in a Fractured state, then move in for the kill as they lose their turn and ability to defend themselves. Taking damage? Hold out long enough and unleash a character's Break Skill, turning the tide of battle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Skill Growth:</strong> Lioren channels Light and Dark powers as he fights, growing in power. His strength grows with consistent use: As a master magician, he will unlock the powerful Light Mode; as a fighter, the equivalent Dark Mode - or tread the path in the middle, balancing both and keep his options open in every battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766600/extras/84edd8d56290572d2013c910783a4475.poster.avif?t=1773407703\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766600/extras/84edd8d56290572d2013c910783a4475.webm?t=1773407703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich, Complex Story:</strong> Inspired by visual novels, Eclipse of Fate mixes rich dialogue interactions between Lioren's companions and the characters they meet, blending storytelling with exploration. Follow his story as he grapples with his own identity and purpose in a rapidly distorting world...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766600/extras/937915658a52ad12f76242809da4872e.poster.avif?t=1773407703\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766600/extras/937915658a52ad12f76242809da4872e.webm?t=1773407703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Twilight","Team Luminous"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766600/2a007842a9e20d582bcfe5329ab87c3e0be7779d/header.jpg?t=1773407703","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3766600/53846230/2151ee5cbad7bc66693bb6e106d111b3f3624ef6/1765180246/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772653787","dash_h264